B.a2w=new A.h("Midsize jets offer the perfect balance of range, speed, and spacious cabin comfort for groups of up to eight passengers. Featuring generous stand-up headroom, ample luggage compartment capacity, and transcontinental capabilities, midsize jets provide superior performance for medium-haul journeys while maintaining optimal flexibility.","Les jets interm\xe9diaires offrent un \xe9quilibre parfait entre autonomie, vitesse et confort de cabine pour jusqu'\xe0 huit passagers.","Mittelgro\xdfe Jets bieten die perfekte Balance aus Reichweite, Geschwindigkeit und ger\xe4umigem Kabinenkomfort f\xfcr bis zu acht Passagiere.","\u062a\u0648\u0641\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0637\u0627\u0626\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0645\u062a\u0648\u0633\u0637\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u062c\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0648\u0627\u0632\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062b\u0627\u0644\u064a \u0628\u064a\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062f\u0649 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0633\u0631\u0639\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0629 \u0644\u063a\u0627\u064a\u0629 8 \u0631\u0643\u0627\u0628.")
