B.a6F=new A.h("Kyoto, Japan: Experience the serene beauty of temples and gardens before the summer heat arrives. Swiss Luxury Services arranges luxurious flights and private tours of this fascinating cultural city for you.","","","")
B.a4S=new A.h("South Africa (Cape Town & Surroundings): Enjoy mild weather, first-class wines, and unforgettable safaris without the summer crowds. We offer exclusive accommodations and private driver experiences.","","","")
