B.a6y=new A.h("What documents do I need to enter Thailand?","","","")
B.uS=new A.h("Since May 1st, Thailand has replaced the traditional paper immigration form with a convenient digital arrival card (Thailand Digital Arrival Card \u2013 TDAC). This change applies to all travelers entering the country by air, land, or sea.","","","")
B.Po=new A.Q(B.w,B.uS,B.j,"")
B.a2y=new A.h("What does this mean for you?","","","")
B.O3=new A.Q(B.A,B.a2y,B.j,"")
B.a01=new A.h("The introduction of the TDAC aims to simplify entry formalities and speed up border crossings. Additionally, the Thai government expects to increase security through better traceability of travelers.","","","")
B.N4=new A.Q(B.w,B.a01,B.j,"")
B.a5_=new A.h("Key points about the Thailand Digital Arrival Card","","","")
B.Or=new A.Q(B.A,B.a5_,B.j,"")
B.a2s=new A.h("Online Registration: You can easily apply through the TDAC internet portal.","","","")
B.a75=new A.h("Observe the deadline: Please complete the online form within 72 hours before your planned arrival in Thailand.","","","")
B.a6z=new A.h("Free of charge: Registration is free until further notice.","","","")
B.a3_=new A.h("Validity: The registration is valid only for your current trip.","","","")
B.a44=new A.h("Accommodation: When providing your first accommodation in Thailand, a complete address is required. Stating only the hotel name and city is not sufficient.","","","")
