B.a4R=new A.h("Helicopter transfers offer the fastest and most direct route between Zurich Airport and Davos. The flight takes approximately 45 minutes, bypassing the winding mountain roads and potential traffic delays. This option is ideal for WEF attendees who value time and comfort.","","","")
