B.a68=new A.h("Arrival by Private Jet: Private jet travelers may enter through Colombo (CMB) or Mattala Rajapaksa International Airport (HRI). Both airports offer VIP terminals, dedicated customs clearance, and\u2014upon request\u2014direct limousine transfers to hotels or helicopter connections to remote resorts.","","","")
